<?xml version="1.0"?>
<Fleet xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <Name>Completely Normal Unobjectionable CL Fleet AFAIK</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>Stock/Alliance</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=green&gt;EASY&lt;/color&gt;

Task Force Birch is comprised of three light cruisers with medium cannons and electronic warfare. This fleet excels at hunting down lightly armoured lineships and clippers, but its weapons can struggle against armoured monitors. Use superior mobility and jammers to pick fights you can win and escape from fights that you can't, but beware of being flanked. Light cruisers can be easily dismantled if attacked from the sides where their armour is less angled and they are easier to hit. Using the HDG order to point your ships' angled bows toward the enemy will significantly enhance this taskforce's survivability.
  </Description>
